                number: 4,
                title: "The Real Threat",
                category: "Identity & Mindset Posts (10 posts)",
                content: `Let's talk about what AI actually threatens in legal practice.

Not lawyers. AI ENABLES lawyers.
Not legal quality. AI ACCELERATES iteration toward quality.
Not professional judgment. AI AMPLIFIES judgment.

What AI threatens:
- Lawyers who refuse to adapt
- Firms stuck in old workflows
- Professional judgment that doesn't get multiplied

The displacement isn't human vs. machine.
It's adapted vs. not adapted.

I've taught hundreds of professionals at this point across multiple fields.

The ones who struggle? Not the ones who "aren't technical."

The ones who struggle are the ones who've decided they already know what AI can't do.

Closed minds get left behind.
Open minds get upgraded.

Which are you?

#LegalAI #Adaptation #ProfessionalDevelopment

---`,
                preview: "Let's talk about what AI actually threatens in legal practice. Not lawyers. AI ENABLES lawyers. Not legal quality. AI ACCELERATES iteration toward quality. Not…",
                wordCount: 115,
