                title: "Email 1: THE BIG HELLO",
                category: "Launch Sequence",
                content: `Subject: Welcome to the AI Upgrade for Legal Professionals

Hey there,

Kris Krug here. Founder of The Upgrade AI. Photographer. Technologist. Professional question-asker. And now: someone who helps legal professionals navigate the AI transformation.

I'm writing because you signed up to learn more about AI Upgrade for Legal Professionals. And I wanted to be the one to say hello.

Here's the deal:

You're probably wondering if AI is going to replace you. Or at least dramatically change what you do for a living. And honestly? **Both are true and neither is true.**

The legal professionals who thrive over the next decade won't be the ones fighting AI. They won't be the ones ignoring it. They'll be the ones **building with it.**

That's what we teach. Not how to use ChatGPT (you can figure that out on YouTube). We teach you how to think in frameworks, build custom assistants, and turn AI from a threat into a practice superpower.

Our next cohort kicks off soon. Over the next few days, I'm going to share:
- What we actually teach (spoiler: it's not tool tutorials)
- Why our approach starts with ethics and confidentiality
- Projected stories of what legal pros could build
- How to know if this is right for you

For now, I'll leave you with one question:

**What would you build if you knew you couldn't fail at the technical parts?**

A client intake system that actually understands your practice? A research assistant that knows your jurisdiction? A document generator that captures your analysis patterns?

Sit with that. I'll be back in a couple days.

— Kris

P.S. If you're already sold and just want the details, reply "READY" and I'll send you the full curriculum and application link.

---`,
                preview: "Hey there, Kris Krug here. Founder of The Upgrade AI. Photographer. Technologist. Professional question-asker. And now: someone who helps legal professionals n…",
